{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-chart",
  "category": "data-viz",
  "title": "Charts",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "styles": [
    "/* Rejilla del overview: se acomoda al ancho real del panel, no al viewport. */",
    "    .chart-grid {",
    "      display: grid;",
    "      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(19rem, 1fr));",
    "      gap: 1rem;",
    "      margin-top: 0.75rem;",
    "    }",
    "    .chart-card {",
    "      border: 1px solid var(--iswc-border);",
    "      border-radius: var(--iswc-radius);",
    "      background: var(--iswc-bg-elev);",
    "      padding: 0.875rem;",
    "      min-width: 0;",
    "    }",
    "    .chart-card h4 {",
    "      margin: 0 0 0.15rem;",
    "      font-size: 0.8125rem;",
    "      font-weight: 600;",
    "    }",
    "    .chart-card p {",
    "      margin: 0 0 0.6rem;",
    "      font-size: 0.75rem;",
    "      line-height: 1.45;",
    "      color: var(--iswc-text-dim);",
    "    }",
    "    .chart-card__plot { height: 15rem; }",
    "    .chart-card__plot.iswc-tall { height: 18rem; }",
    "    .spark-row {",
    "      display: flex;",
    "      align-items: center;",
    "      justify-content: space-between;",
    "      gap: 0.75rem;",
    "      padding: 0.45rem 0;",
    "      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--iswc-border-soft);",
    "      font-size: 0.8125rem;",
    "    }",
    "    .spark-row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }",
    "    .spark-row b { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }"
  ],
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-chart",
  "hasBehavior": true,
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Charts",
      "lede": [
        "Motor de gráficos en SVG, sin dependencias externas. La configuración usa el",
        "          mismo esquema de Chart.js, así que un <code>config</code> existente funciona",
        "          sin cambios."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          Cada tipo tiene su elemento (<code>&lt;iswc-bar-chart&gt;</code>,",
            "          <code>&lt;iswc-line-chart&gt;</code>…) y además está",
            "          <code>&lt;iswc-chart type=\"…\"&gt;</code>, que resuelve el tipo en tiempo de",
            "          ejecución. Los colores salen de la paleta de marca activa y se revalidan al",
            "          cambiar de tema: pruébalo con el selector de paleta del encabezado.",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-chart open-on-click type=\"bar\" label=\"Ingresos vs gastos\" x-label=\"Mes\" y-label=\"Millones COP\">",
            "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "              {",
            "                \"data\": {",
            "                  \"labels\": [\"Ene\", \"Feb\", \"Mar\", \"Abr\", \"May\", \"Jun\"],",
            "                  \"datasets\": [",
            "                    { \"label\": \"Ingresos\", \"data\": [48, 56, 62, 58, 71, 68] },",
            "                    { \"label\": \"Gastos\", \"data\": [35, 38, 40, 42, 45, 43] }",
            "                  ]",
            "                }",
            "              }",
            "            </script>",
            "          </iswc-chart>"
          ],
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:open-on-click",
              "label": "open-on-click"
            },
            {
              "control": "select",
              "prop": "attr:type",
              "label": "type",
              "options": [
                "bar",
                "line"
              ]
            },
            {
              "control": "text",
              "prop": "attr:x-label",
              "label": "x-label"
            },
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:without-legend",
              "label": "without-legend"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "comparacion",
      "title": "Comparar cantidades",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>Barras: lo correcto cuando el lector compara magnitudes entre categorías.</p>",
            "        <div class=\"chart-grid\">",
            "",
            "          <article class=\"chart-card\">",
            "            <h4>Una serie</h4>",
            "            <p><code>&lt;iswc-bar-chart&gt;</code></p>",
            "            <div class=\"chart-card__plot\">",
            "              <iswc-bar-chart>",
            "                <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "                  { \"data\": { \"labels\": [\"Ene\", \"Feb\", \"Mar\", \"Abr\", \"May\", \"Jun\"],",
            "                    \"datasets\": [{ \"label\": \"Ventas\", \"data\": [4200000, 5100000, 3800000, 6400000, 5900000, 7200000] }] } }",
            "                </script>",
            "              </iswc-bar-chart>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </article>",
            "",
            "          <article class=\"chart-card\">",
            "            <h4>Agrupada</h4>",
            "            <p>Varias series comparten categoría.</p>",
            "            <div class=\"chart-card__plot\">",
            "              <iswc-bar-chart>",
            "                <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "                  { \"data\": { \"labels\": [\"Q1\", \"Q2\", \"Q3\", \"Q4\"], \"datasets\": [",
            "                    { \"label\": \"Ingresos\", \"data\": [32, 45, 38, 52] },",
            "                    { \"label\": \"Costos\", \"data\": [22, 28, 25, 31] },",
            "                    { \"label\": \"Utilidad\", \"data\": [10, 17, 13, 21] } ] } }",
            "                </script>",
            "              </iswc-bar-chart>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </article>",
            "",
            "          <article class=\"chart-card\">",
            "            <h4>Apilada</h4>",
            "            <p>Atributo <code>stacked</code>: composición dentro del total.</p>",
            "            <div class=\"chart-card__plot\">",
            "              <iswc-bar-chart stacked>",
            "                <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "                  { \"data\": { \"labels\": [\"Ene\", \"Feb\", \"Mar\", \"Abr\"], \"datasets\": [",
            "                    { \"label\": \"Contado\", \"data\": [18, 22, 20, 27] },",
            "                    { \"label\": \"Crédito\", \"data\": [12, 15, 18, 14] },",
            "                    { \"label\": \"Anticipos\", \"data\": [5, 7, 6, 9] } ] } }",
            "                </script>",
            "              </iswc-bar-chart>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </article>",
            "",
            "          <article class=\"chart-card\">",
            "            <h4>Horizontal</h4>",
            "            <p><code>index-axis=\"y\"</code>: mejor con etiquetas largas.</p>",
            "            <div class=\"chart-card__plot\">",
            "              <iswc-bar-chart index-axis=\"y\">",
            "                <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "                  { \"data\": { \"labels\": [\"Bogotá\", \"Medellín\", \"Cali\", \"Barranquilla\", \"Bucaramanga\"],",
            "                    \"datasets\": [{ \"label\": \"Clientes\", \"data\": [1240, 890, 610, 430, 280] }] } }",
            "                </script>",
            "              </iswc-bar-chart>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </article>",
            "",
            "          <article class=\"chart-card\">",
            "            <h4>Con negativos</h4>",
            "            <p>La línea base marca el cero.</p>",
            "            <div class=\"chart-card__plot\">",
            "              <iswc-bar-chart>",
            "                <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "                  { \"data\": { \"labels\": [\"Ene\", \"Feb\", \"Mar\", \"Abr\", \"May\"],",
            "                    \"datasets\": [{ \"label\": \"Flujo neto\", \"data\": [12, -8, 15, -4, 22] }] } }",
            "                </script>",
            "              </iswc-bar-chart>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </article>",
            "",
            "        </div>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tendencia",
      "title": "Mostrar tendencia",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>Líneas: cuando importa la dirección del cambio en el tiempo.</p>",
            "        <div class=\"chart-grid\">",
            "",
            "          <article class=\"chart-card\">",
            "            <h4>Dos series, curva</h4>",
            "            <p><code>tension: 0.4</code> en el dataset.</p>",
            "            <div class=\"chart-card__plot\">",
            "              <iswc-line-chart>",
            "                <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "                  { \"data\": { \"labels\": [\"Ene\", \"Feb\", \"Mar\", \"Abr\", \"May\", \"Jun\"], \"datasets\": [",
            "                    { \"label\": \"2025\", \"data\": [30, 42, 38, 55, 48, 62], \"tension\": 0.4 },",
            "                    { \"label\": \"2024\", \"data\": [25, 30, 34, 40, 39, 45], \"tension\": 0.4 } ] } }",
            "                </script>",
            "              </iswc-line-chart>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </article>",
            "",
            "          <article class=\"chart-card\">",
            "            <h4>Área</h4>",
            "            <p><code>fill: true</code> rellena bajo la línea.</p>",
            "            <div class=\"chart-card__plot\">",
            "              <iswc-line-chart>",
            "                <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "                  { \"data\": { \"labels\": [\"L\", \"M\", \"X\", \"J\", \"V\", \"S\", \"D\"], \"datasets\": [",
            "                    { \"label\": \"Visitas\", \"data\": [120, 190, 170, 240, 280, 210, 150], \"fill\": true, \"tension\": 0.4 } ] } }",
            "                </script>",
            "              </iswc-line-chart>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </article>",
            "",
            "          <article class=\"chart-card\">",
            "            <h4>Escalonada</h4>",
            "            <p><code>stepped: true</code>: valores que cambian de golpe.</p>",
            "            <div class=\"chart-card__plot\">",
            "              <iswc-line-chart>",
            "                <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "                  { \"data\": { \"labels\": [\"v1\", \"v2\", \"v3\", \"v4\", \"v5\", \"v6\"], \"datasets\": [",
            "                    { \"label\": \"Plan\", \"data\": [10, 10, 25, 25, 40, 40], \"stepped\": true } ] } }",
            "                </script>",
            "              </iswc-line-chart>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </article>",
            "",
            "        </div>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "proporcion",
      "title": "Mostrar proporción",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          Partes de un total. Con más de seis rebanadas dejan de ser legibles y",
            "          conviene una barra horizontal.",
            "        </p>",
            "        <div class=\"chart-grid\">",
            "",
            "          <article class=\"chart-card\">",
            "            <h4>Pie</h4>",
            "            <p>El porcentaje se rotula dentro de cada rebanada.</p>",
            "            <div class=\"chart-card__plot\">",
            "              <iswc-pie-chart>",
            "                <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "                  { \"data\": { \"labels\": [\"Contado\", \"Crédito 30\", \"Crédito 60\", \"Crédito 90\"],",
            "                    \"datasets\": [{ \"label\": \"Cartera\", \"data\": [45, 25, 18, 12] }] } }",
            "                </script>",
            "              </iswc-pie-chart>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </article>",
            "",
            "          <article class=\"chart-card\">",
            "            <h4>Doughnut</h4>",
            "            <p>El hueco muestra el total.</p>",
            "            <div class=\"chart-card__plot\">",
            "              <iswc-doughnut-chart>",
            "                <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "                  { \"data\": { \"labels\": [\"Inventario\", \"Cartera\", \"Bancos\", \"Activo fijo\"],",
            "                    \"datasets\": [{ \"label\": \"Activos\", \"data\": [3200, 2100, 1450, 5300] }] } }",
            "                </script>",
            "              </iswc-doughnut-chart>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </article>",
            "",
            "          <article class=\"chart-card\">",
            "            <h4>Polar area</h4>",
            "            <p>Ángulo fijo, radio según el valor.</p>",
            "            <div class=\"chart-card__plot\">",
            "              <iswc-polar-area-chart>",
            "                <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "                  { \"data\": { \"labels\": [\"Norte\", \"Sur\", \"Este\", \"Oeste\", \"Centro\"],",
            "                    \"datasets\": [{ \"label\": \"Cobertura\", \"data\": [11, 16, 7, 14, 9] }] } }",
            "                </script>",
            "              </iswc-polar-area-chart>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </article>",
            "",
            "        </div>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "correlacion",
      "title": "Correlación y multivariable",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"chart-grid\">",
            "",
            "          <article class=\"chart-card\">",
            "            <h4>Scatter</h4>",
            "            <p>Dos ejes numéricos, un punto por observación.</p>",
            "            <div class=\"chart-card__plot\">",
            "              <iswc-scatter-chart x-label=\"Antigüedad (días)\" y-label=\"Saldo\">",
            "                <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "                  { \"data\": { \"datasets\": [",
            "                    { \"label\": \"Facturas\", \"data\": [",
            "                      {\"x\":5,\"y\":120},{\"x\":18,\"y\":340},{\"x\":32,\"y\":210},{\"x\":45,\"y\":560},",
            "                      {\"x\":60,\"y\":430},{\"x\":75,\"y\":720},{\"x\":88,\"y\":510},{\"x\":95,\"y\":880} ] } ] } }",
            "                </script>",
            "              </iswc-scatter-chart>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </article>",
            "",
            "          <article class=\"chart-card\">",
            "            <h4>Bubble</h4>",
            "            <p>El radio <code>r</code> agrega una tercera dimensión.</p>",
            "            <div class=\"chart-card__plot\">",
            "              <iswc-bubble-chart x-label=\"Margen %\" y-label=\"Volumen\">",
            "                <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "                  { \"data\": { \"datasets\": [",
            "                    { \"label\": \"Productos\", \"data\": [",
            "                      {\"x\":12,\"y\":40,\"r\":10},{\"x\":24,\"y\":75,\"r\":18},{\"x\":33,\"y\":55,\"r\":8},",
            "                      {\"x\":45,\"y\":90,\"r\":24},{\"x\":58,\"y\":62,\"r\":14} ] } ] } }",
            "                </script>",
            "              </iswc-bubble-chart>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </article>",
            "",
            "          <article class=\"chart-card\">",
            "            <h4>Radar</h4>",
            "            <p>Compara varias métricas entre dos conjuntos.</p>",
            "            <div class=\"chart-card__plot iswc-tall\">",
            "              <iswc-radar-chart>",
            "                <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "                  { \"data\": { \"labels\": [\"Liquidez\", \"Rentabilidad\", \"Endeudamiento\", \"Eficiencia\", \"Crecimiento\"],",
            "                    \"datasets\": [",
            "                      { \"label\": \"Empresa\", \"data\": [65, 78, 45, 82, 70] },",
            "                      { \"label\": \"Sector\", \"data\": [55, 62, 60, 58, 52] } ] } }",
            "                </script>",
            "              </iswc-radar-chart>",
            "            </div>",
            "          </article>",
            "",
            "        </div>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "micro",
      "title": "Micro-gráficos",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          <code>&lt;iswc-sparkline&gt;</code> va en línea con el texto, sin ejes ni",
            "          leyenda. El atributo <code>trend</code> usa los colores semánticos del sistema.",
            "        </p>",
            "        <div class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width:26rem\">",
            "          <div class=\"spark-row\">",
            "            <span>Ventas</span>",
            "            <iswc-sparkline trend=\"positive\" values=\"4,6,5,8,7,11,13\"></iswc-sparkline>",
            "            <b>+18%</b>",
            "          </div>",
            "          <div class=\"spark-row\">",
            "            <span>Cartera vencida</span>",
            "            <iswc-sparkline trend=\"negative\" values=\"12,11,13,9,8,6,5\"></iswc-sparkline>",
            "            <b>−22%</b>",
            "          </div>",
            "          <div class=\"spark-row\">",
            "            <span>Rotación</span>",
            "            <iswc-sparkline trend=\"neutral\" type=\"bar\" values=\"5,7,6,8,6,7,7\"></iswc-sparkline>",
            "            <b>=</b>",
            "          </div>",
            "          <div class=\"spark-row\">",
            "            <span>Margen</span>",
            "            <iswc-sparkline variant=\"gradient\" curve=\"natural\" values=\"3,5,4,7,6,9,12\"></iswc-sparkline>",
            "            <b>+31%</b>",
            "          </div>",
            "        </div>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "config",
      "title": "Configuración",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          Los datos entran por un <code>&lt;script type=\"application/json\"&gt;</code> hijo",
            "          o por la propiedad <code>config</code>. El esquema es el de Chart.js:",
            "          <code>{ type, data: { labels, datasets }, options }</code>.",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Atributos</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Nombre",
            "Valores",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>type</code>",
              "bar · line · pie · doughnut · radar · polarArea · scatter · bubble",
              "Solo en <code>&lt;iswc-chart&gt;</code>; los elementos tipados lo fijan."
            ],
            [
              "<code>label</code>",
              "texto",
              "Título sobre el gráfico."
            ],
            [
              "<code>x-label</code> · <code>y-label</code>",
              "texto",
              "Títulos de eje."
            ],
            [
              "<code>index-axis</code>",
              "<code>x</code> · <code>y</code>",
              "<code>y</code> produce barras horizontales."
            ],
            [
              "<code>stacked</code>",
              "booleano",
              "Apila las series."
            ],
            [
              "<code>grid</code>",
              "<code>auto</code> · <code>both</code> · <code>x</code> · <code>y</code> · <code>none</code>",
              "Por defecto solo el eje de valor."
            ],
            [
              "<code>min</code> · <code>max</code>",
              "número",
              "Fija el dominio del eje de valor."
            ],
            [
              "<code>legend-position</code>",
              "<code>top</code> · <code>bottom</code> · <code>start</code> · <code>end</code>",
              "Ubicación de la leyenda."
            ],
            [
              "<code>without-legend</code> · <code>without-tooltip</code> · <code>without-animation</code>",
              "booleano",
              "Desactivan cada parte."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Propiedades del dataset</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Nombre",
            "Aplica a",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>label</code>",
              "todos",
              "Nombre de la serie en leyenda y tooltip."
            ],
            [
              "<code>backgroundColor</code> · <code>borderColor</code>",
              "todos",
              "Fuerzan el color; si faltan, se usa la paleta de marca."
            ],
            [
              "<code>tension</code>",
              "line",
              "Mayor que 0 dibuja curva suave."
            ],
            [
              "<code>stepped</code>",
              "line",
              "Línea escalonada."
            ],
            [
              "<code>fill</code>",
              "line",
              "Rellena el área bajo la línea."
            ],
            [
              "<code>borderRadius</code>",
              "bar",
              "Radio del extremo de la barra."
            ],
            [
              "<code>borderWidth</code> · <code>pointRadius</code>",
              "line · scatter",
              "Grosor del trazo y tamaño del punto."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Opciones</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>",
            "          De <code>config.options</code> se leen",
            "          <code>scales.{x,y}.{min,max,stacked,beginAtZero,title.text}</code>,",
            "          <code>plugins.legend.{display,position}</code>,",
            "          <code>plugins.title.{display,text}</code>,",
            "          <code>plugins.tooltip.enabled</code>, <code>indexAxis</code> y",
            "          <code>cutout</code>. Cuando un atributo del elemento y una opción definen lo",
            "          mismo, gana el atributo.",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Config por JavaScript</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<iswc-chart open-on-click id=\"jsChart\" type=\"line\" without-legend></iswc-chart>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3>Propiedades del elemento</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Nombre",
            "Descripción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>config</code>",
              "Configuración completa; asignarla vuelve a dibujar."
            ],
            [
              "<code>svg</code>",
              "Nodo <code>&lt;svg&gt;</code> del gráfico (solo lectura)."
            ],
            [
              "<code>chart</code>",
              "Alias histórico de <code>svg</code>."
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ficha": {
    "sections": {
      "anatomia": {
        "content": [
          "Motor de gráficos en SVG, sin dependencias externas. La configuración usa el",
          "          mismo esquema de Chart.js, así que un <code>config</code> existente funciona",
          "          sin cambios."
        ]
      },
      "ejemplos": {
        "content": [
          "```html",
          "<iswc-chart open-on-click type=\"bar\" label=\"Ingresos vs gastos\" x-label=\"Mes\" y-label=\"Millones COP\">",
          "            <script type=\"application/json\">",
          "              {",
          "                \"data\": {",
          "                  \"labels\": [\"Ene\", \"Feb\", \"Mar\", \"Abr\", \"May\", \"Jun\"],",
          "                  \"datasets\": [",
          "                    { \"label\": \"Ingresos\", \"data\": [48, 56, 62, 58, 71, 68] },",
          "                    { \"label\": \"Gastos\", \"data\": [35, 38, 40, 42, 45, 43] }",
          "                  ]",
          "                }",
          "              }",
          "            </script>",
          "          </iswc-chart>",
          "```"
        ]
      }
    },
    "exclude": [
      "apiJs",
      "atributos",
      "eventos",
      "parts",
      "props",
      "slots",
      "states"
    ]
  }
}
